        <item>
            <title>0.14.64</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 25 Jun 2026 13:47:52 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>125</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.14.64</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Long recordings no longer make the whole Mac lag or run hot. The disk writes that happen during capture were moved off the main thread, and a redundant system-audio tap is now dropped when you are not on Bluetooth, so the machine stays responsive through a long session.</li>
<li>The floating recording equalizer animates smoothly and fills up properly now, even from a quiet microphone.</li>
<li>Transcripts no longer invent a line attributed to you over a stretch where your microphone was actually silent.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
